ech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916250830\",\"name\":\"2. Can students from non-technical streams learn data science?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, students from any stream, arts, commerce, or science, can learn data science. While technical knowledge like mathematics or programming helps, beginners from non-technical backgrounds can start with basic courses and gradually build skills.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916271371\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916271371\",\"name\":\"3. Is coding knowledge required to start a data science course?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Coding is not mandatory for beginners. You can start with no-code tools like Excel or Power BI. Learning programming languages such as Python or R becomes important as you advance in data science.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916326224\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916326224\",\"name\":\"4. Can I pursue a data science course after 12th?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, you can enroll in certificate, diploma, or undergraduate programs after completing 12th. Students from any stream are eligible, though a basic understanding of computers and mathematics can help in grasping concepts faster.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916338924\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916338924\",\"name\":\"5. What are the eligibility criteria for postgraduate data science courses?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Postgraduate programs usually require a bachelor\u2019s degree in any field. Some institutes prefer students from technical or science backgrounds and may ask for minimum marks or prior knowledge in mathematics, statistics, or programming.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916352152\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916352152\",\"name\":\"6. Can working professionals or career switchers learn data science?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. Data science courses are flexible and beginner-friendly. Professionals can start with online or part-time programs. Basic computer knowledge, analytical thinking, and dedication are sufficient to build a successful career.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916362816\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-eligibility\/#faq-question-1773916362816\",\"name\":\"7. Are there any percentage or grade requirements for data science courses?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Short-term and online courses usually have no strict percentage requirements. For undergraduate and postgraduate programs, many institutes require around 50%\u201360% marks in previous qualifications. Requirements may vary by college or program.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",